Week 13: Order Service and Inventory consumer dispatch concurrency (option, default 1) and concurrency-safe acknowledgements and requeue publishes in all five consumers.
Code under test: fd27e4d plus the working-tree changes, built from a clean clone on E: (all three services build with 0 warnings). Unit tests: 98 passed, 6 skipped, the same as unmodified fd27e4d.
Pass A = concurrency 1 (the default). Pass B = RabbitMQ__EventBus__ConsumerDispatchConcurrency=4, inherited by every service the verifiers start (Order and Inventory both read it).

